cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these formalizations, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "llm-audit-lean: Lean formalizations from a self-audit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Aronow"
    given-names: "P. M."
date-released: "2026-10-25"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pmaronow/llm-audit-lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalizations of mathematical claims from 50 published works by P. M. Aronow and coauthors, made during a
  self-audit of that work: 4795 credited component results (4314 proved, 481 counterexample results)
  for 1000 of 1021 registered paper claims, with general results in probability, asymptotic statistics, randomization inference, survey sampling
  and causal identification. Developed with AI agents under the author's direction, including adapted third-party code attributed in NOTICE; checked by the Lean kernel with standard axioms only.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - statistics
  - causal inference
  - probability
  - randomization inference
  - survey sampling
